lass=\"bb_tag\">Epic Battle Fantasy 5 does NOT feature...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Annoying random battles.<br></li><li> Limited save points.<br></li><li> Depressed protagonists.<br></li><li> Points of no return. </li></ul><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/432350/extras/da34b6d600a2bc14b8908bf94f82de31.poster.avif?t=1720824507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/432350/extras/da34b6d600a2bc14b8908bf94f82de31.webm?t=1720824507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/432350/extras/da34b6d600a2bc14b8908bf94f82de31.mp4?t=1720824507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
